Make the impure blood of all creatures around you in radius 10 boil.

Each enemy afflicted by a disease, poison, or wound will have one removed at random dealing [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage, healing you for [52, 70, 85, 97, 107 (TL1-5; SP 100)], and slowing them by [29%, 44%, 53%, 59%, 64% (TL1-5)] for 5 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
